# Author remapping for git shortlog / log / blame / statistics.
#
# The default-placeholder identity "Your Name <you@example.com>" was used by
# AI-assistant commit sessions (git was left unconfigured). They are remapped
# to "Codex" to reflect the actual AI authorship. Piero's several machine-local
# emails are consolidated to his canonical address.
#
# Note: .mailmap changes how git (and GitHub's contributor views) DISPLAY
# authors; it does not rewrite commit objects/hashes.

Codex <you@example.com>

Piero Borgatta <info@pieroborgatta.com> <pbr@MacBook-Pro-di-Piero.local>
